4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W4lVZqRjzPgQ7kNvwEfqTVu&_nc_oc=AdpkaWN7OYAZIeoeSJ-6oLd0TbZV0iBLSxOspcwiFWKxADk_h4TtFi_NLnd-ynPOuV4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBO9nij17fsxVok-NNQOFwX_8nKxq41-x21LBYrJwfqyg&oe=6A58D6D4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=73nRYwyl_VEQ7kNvwHSM99p&_nc_oc=Adpn-5bCpusyPwagmafm8g5mfmKu7nKjXkqVQQIl7cGTD6DXS-aaPr1ta0titn2Nhz4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAEAwkzSz_QIGIpMCG15spDrdtTwOioTx4jl0UwpRprdw&oe=6A58DBB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X2G0iO9lYXgQ7kNvwHKW6DA&_nc_oc=AdpR3-DYJi5M-U8iJz5RNR34q59MKFKsyPcqvKNeI7BbLtYAb5X0dMH7y1XhOpmNoF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDqjdkCxgTw7fVnfUGv9DhuA-GbgTrdURCsPCoDXz8tCg&oe=6A58E955"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p